<section class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THE CALDOVA WAY</span><h1>Made with time.<br />Shared with heart.</h1><p>A neighborhood bakery for everyday celebrations.</p></section>
<section class="story-band"><img src="~/images/hero.jpg" alt="Handmade croissants fresh from the oven" /><div><h2>Simple ingredients.<br />Something special.</h2><p>Caldova is built around a simple idea: a good bakery brings people together. An unhurried breakfast, a loaf for the table, a cake just because.</p><p>Our menu celebrates familiar favorites, from our country sourdough to buttery pastries and generous cookies. Everything is baked in small batches.</p><a class="button" asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Index">Find your favorite <i data-lucide="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></section>
<section class="section prose"><h2>A note on ingredients</h2><p>Our bakes may contain wheat, milk, eggs, soy, peanuts and tree nuts. Products share preparation areas. This demonstration menu does not provide verified allergen information.</p></section>